Ques13:
Can an IoT system be considered "smart" if it does not use Artificial Intelligence? Justify your answer with suitable examples. What
differentiates “smart” from “intelligent”? 
Ans – Yes, an IoT system can be smart even without AI. It can collect sensor data, communicate with other devices, and make decisions using
predefined rules. For example, a smart irrigation system that automatically turns on the pump when the soil is dry is smart, even though it
does not use AI. AI makes the system more intelligent by helping it learn and make better decisions over time. 
